content": "Le verbe aller au futur simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le verbe <span class=\"italic\">aller</span> signifie : <ol><li>se d\u00e9placer d'un lieu \u00e0 un autre. </li><li>se d\u00e9placer pour accomplir une action.</li></ol>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Aller\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"j'irai<br/>tu iras<br/>il/elle/on ira<br/>nous irons<br/>vous irez<br/>ils/elles iront\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "J'irai peut-\u00eatre faire le tour de l'Europe.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Faites une liste de tous les cours mentionn\u00e9s dans la le\u00e7on. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compl\u00e9tez le tableau ci-dessous. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Expliquez vos choix \u00e0 un(e) camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cours que je veux suivre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cours que je ne veux pas suivre\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Je ne sais pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je fais une liste des cours cit\u00e9s dans la le\u00e7on. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je compl\u00e8te le tableau. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'explique mes choix \u00e0 un(e) camarade. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "frn5le08ob11re2img07.jpg", "audiosrc": "frn5le08ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "frn5le08ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "frn5le08ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Est-ce que tu as pass\u00e9 tous tes examens ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Oui, l'\u00e9preuve de comptabilit\u00e9 \u00e9tait tr\u00e8s difficile. Mes camarades de classe m'ont beaucoup aid\u00e9."}, {"time": "7000", "image": "frn5le08ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Quel a \u00e9t\u00e9 ton cours pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : J'ai vraiment aim\u00e9 le cours d'\u00e9conomie et aussi de strat\u00e9gie de la communication. On a appris \u00e0 concevoir des campagnes de communication.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  \u00c7a a l'air int\u00e9ressant. Est-ce que tu as eu un cours de <br/>n\u00e9gociation ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Et non, malheureusement."}, {"time": "20500", "image": "frn5le08ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Quelles sont les prochaines \u00e9tapes ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Je vais probablement postuler \u00e0 plusieurs emplois. Si je trouve du travail, je resterai ici. Sinon, je voyagerai comme toi. Qu'est-ce que tu en penses ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : C'est une bonne id\u00e9e. Tu devrais faire une pause.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :  O\u00f9 me conseilles-tu d'aller ?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Tu pourrais aller en Espagne. C'est vraiment un beau pays.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :  J'irai peut-\u00eatre faire le tour de l'Europe. \u00c7a pourrait \u00eatre bien."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 4, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "", "audiosrc": "", "images": []}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 6, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le10ob11re5aud01 "}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [], "id": 8, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le10ob11re6aud01"}], "title": "", "type": "text", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler des \u00e9tudes. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander et donner des conseils.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des actions futures.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Que ferez-vous apr\u00e8s les \u00e9tudes&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quels sont vos projets professionnels&nbsp;?  ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Coin r\u00e9vision.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">pass\u00e9</span> tous ses examens. Il parle avec Charlotte : Quelle est la prochaine \u00e9tape ?", "type": "te